// Least kept winning labeled hamming not equal to the lower central value.
// An empty difference set returns -1, not 0. A least of 0 stays 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE lnel ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG lnel rank

IMPULSE lnel 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "lnel" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
